        "implementation_status": "PARTIAL",
        "next_action": "Implement small reversible package releases; Shell and Chat code are scaffolds until login, chat, and target-health evidence pass.",
        "requirement_digest": "e4132619d068cb4403e647cb6b06cf141988778ef6b7aa76877987fb78129c15",
        "requirement_id": "REQ-4BB581C90577",
        "requirement_text": "Migration is a **series of small reversible module releases**. The original `apps/web` remains running on `smartaihub.app` while new sources are selectively copied into clean module packages, with dependency pruning, modern UI replacement where appropriate, actual Debian UAT and Cloudflare staging, then production availability. Core login/tenant/Shell minimum viable vertical slice SHALL be usable first; completion of all Core commerce/admin features is **not** a prerequisite for beginning independent module migration or human tests. “Partially migrated” does not mean feature removed or traffic blindly forwarded.",
        "source_spec_digest": "9776611ad8a6abf08546518ede17d55e03e438ca14e520f17e88cfe87adc11b4",
        "successor_mapping": [],
        "verification_evidence": [
          "handoff/evidence/section-01-build-boundary-20261110.md"
        ],
        "verification_method": "Run explicit package-filtered builds/tests and inspect output scope, Worker size, and forbidden Legacy/Express imports."
      },
      "REQ-8ACA3DD0FDD4": {
        "applicability": "APPLICABLE",
        "authority_refs": [
          "specs/feature/317-smartaihub-progressive-module-migration/spec.md#L171"
        ],
        "authority_source": "specs/feature/317-smartaihub-progressive-module-migration/spec.md#L171",
        "blocker": null,
        "current_relevance": "CURRENT",
        "evidence_freshness": "FRESH",
        "evidence_sha": "ebb264aa0151e97e9e463b7d4ca23290a48569db",
        "final_state": "PARTIAL",
        "implementation_evidence": [
          "smartaihub-platform@ebb264aa0151e97e9e463b7d4ca23290a48569db"
        ],
        "implementation_status": "PARTIAL",
        "next_action": "Implement functional Shell login and lazy Chat assets, then remeasure package-only builds after those features land.",
        "requirement_digest": "0ddd3dfb5a4931244b5f5acabddac2e2658be0706133cbfefca3b91434f553dc",
        "requirement_id": "REQ-8ACA3DD0FDD4",
        "requirement_text": "Build the new experience from small first-party packages: `apps/saas-core` is the Hono API Worker; `apps/saas-shell` is the account/navigation React SPA; `modules/chat` is a separately versioned Chat module with independently built assets and its own API Worker only where needed; shared packages contain only small versioned contracts/SDK primitives. Each deployable app/module SHALL have a package-filtered build command, its own build output, manifest, size record and deploy/rollback scope. A change to Chat SHALL NOT build or restart Core, Shell, Legacy `apps/web`, or another module. The root SHALL NOT provide a default aggregate build that bundles every application/module; build selection is explicit, such as `pnpm --filter @smartaihub/chat build` or the corresponding named script.",
        "source_spec_digest": "9776611ad8a6abf08546518ede17d55e03e438ca14e520f17e88cfe87adc11b4",
        "successor_mapping": [],
        "verification_evidence": [
          "handoff/evidence/section-01-build-boundary-20261110.md"
        ],
        "verification_method": "Run explicit package-filtered builds/tests and inspect output scope, Worker size, and forbidden Legacy/Express imports."
      },
      "REQ-C8D3AE2138BD": {
        "applicability": "APPLICABLE",
        "authority_refs": [
          "specs/feature/317-smartaihub-progressive-module-migration/spec.md#L161"
